Super Mario 64 (src/sm64/sm64/)
================================================================================

The game tree under src/sm64/sm64/ is a vendored, flattened copy of a
Super Mario 64 PC port. It is NOT work of this project except where a file
carries this project's own copyright header. Its provenance is recorded in
src/sm64/sm64/UPSTREAM.md. The attribution chain, in order:

* Nintendo Co., Ltd.
    Original author of Super Mario 64 (1996) — the game design, code, music,
    art and all other original content. Super Mario 64 and Mario are
    trademarks of Nintendo. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED. Nothing in this repository
    grants any right in Nintendo's work.

* The n64decomp/sm64 contributors
    The reverse-engineered, matching decompilation of the retail N64 ROM:
    the C sources under src/, levels/, actors/, data/, text/, the asset
    extraction tooling, and the build system. The vendored tree is at
    decomp "Refresh 11" (src/sm64/sm64/CHANGES:1). This decompiled C
    describes Nintendo's program and remains subject to Nintendo's rights.

* The sm64-port contributors (sm64-port/sm64-port)
    The N64-free port layer: src/pc/ (window/audio/controller backends,
    configfile, mixer, ultra_reimplementation) and the desktop build.

* fgsfdsfgs
    The DOS fork of sm64-port that this tree is actually vendored from
    (branch "dos"): the DJGPP toolchain wiring, gfx_dos_api.c,
    audio_sb16.c, the custom software rasterizer, and lib/{allegro,dmesa,
    glide3,osmesa}. See src/sm64/sm64/README.md:3-9.

* Emill and MaikelChan — Fast3D PC renderer, src/sm64/sm64/src/pc/gfx/
    Copyright (c) 2020 Emill, MaikelChan. Source-only license: see
    src/sm64/sm64/src/pc/gfx/LICENSE.txt. It permits redistribution in
    SOURCE form only and states explicitly:
        "Redistributions in binary form are not allowed."
    This covers gfx_pc.c, gfx_cc.c and the whole src/pc/gfx/ directory,
    INCLUDING this project's own gfx_gpu.c, which lives inside it and is a
    backend for that renderer. Consequently no compiled artifact containing
    this renderer may be redistributed. This is one of the reasons this
    project is distributed as source only.

* Silicon Graphics, Inc.
    The libultra / Fast3D N64 SDK headers under include/PR/, which carry SGI's
