* Nintendo RSP microcode — src/sm64/sm64/lib/PR/{f3dex,f3dex2,s2dex}/*.bin
    The upstream tree ships 24 prebuilt RSP graphics microcode binaries
    authored by Nintendo; e.g. F3DEX_NoN_data.bin contained the string
        "RSP Gfx ucode F3DEX.NoN 1.23 Yoshitaka Yasumoto Nintendo."
    read out of the tracked file before it was removed. Proprietary Nintendo
    binaries, not used by the openfpgaOS build and not this project's work.
    THESE FILES HAVE SINCE BEEN DELETED from this repository's working tree
    and index (together with lib/rsp.s and rsp/). They remain reachable in
