Nintendo disclaimer / no ROM data
================================================================================

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by, or in any way
officially connected to Nintendo Co., Ltd. or any of its subsidiaries or
affiliates. "Super Mario 64", "Mario" and "Nintendo 64" are trademarks of
Nintendo, used here only to identify the work being described.

No ROM, ROM image, or ROM-derived asset is distributed by this repository.
This is a source-only distribution. Building the core requires the user to
supply their own legally obtained copy of the retail ROM (baserom.us.z64);
the build extracts textures, sound and other media from that file locally.
Extracted assets, the resulting build/ tree, and any compiled binary are
therefore local to the user and MUST NOT be redistributed — both because
they contain Nintendo's copyrighted data and because of the binary
redistribution ban on the Fast3D renderer noted above.

